there like, "Unh-unh!

00:14:55.767 --> 00:14:56.968
Here we go!

00:14:56.968 --> 00:14:59.000
You so funny!
We gonna be best friends!"

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.734
I'm like, "Who are you, lady?"
And it was Tiffany.

00:15:02.734 --> 00:15:04.834
-"We're gonna be best friends."
-"What's your number?

00:15:04.834 --> 00:15:07.067
Anytime you in L.A. --"
-Oh, my God. That is so her.

00:15:07.067 --> 00:15:08.934
-And that's how
we became friends.

00:15:08.934 --> 00:15:11.400
She forced the friendship,
and that's --

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:12.801
-She's one of
the funniest people.

00:15:12.801 --> 00:15:13.834
Both of you guys together,
I can't --

00:15:13.834 --> 00:15:15.334
-This is gonna be fun.

00:15:15.334 --> 00:15:16.934
This is two headliners for the
price of one, on tour together.

00:15:16.934 --> 00:15:20.367
-Whoo!
That's what I'm talking about.

00:15:20.367 --> 00:15:21.734
Go check it out right now.

00:15:21.734 --> 00:15:23.100
Lil Rel Howery, everybody.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:24.934
We're going to play a game
after the break.

00:15:24.934 --> 00:15:26.133
Come on back, everybody.

